ercial contracts"},{"text":"Choice of law"},{"text":"Jurisdiction"},{"text":"Arbitration"},{"text":"Cross-border payments"},{"text":"Currency provisions"},{"text":"International taxation awareness"},{"text":"Data-transfer considerations"},{"text":"Sanctions/export-control awareness"},{"text":"International dispute resolution"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Contracts Manager working internationally should understand when specialist legal advice is required."}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Useful supplementary learning areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Contract Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract lifecycle management"},{"text":"Commercial contract management"},{"text":"Contract drafting"},{"text":"Contract negotiation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Business"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Supply-chain fundamentals"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Financial literacy"},{"text":"Business analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CLM platforms"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Legal technology"},{"text":"AI-assisted legal workflows"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Legal writing"},{"text":"Risk management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Professional certifications can become more valuable after gaining practical experience; they should complement rather than replace legal and commercial experience."}]},{"heading":"AI in Contract Management","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI is rapidly changing contract operations."},{"type":"h","text":"Potential Applications"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract summarization"},{"text":"Clause extraction"},{"text":"Risk identification"},{"text":"Obligation extraction"},{"text":"Contract comparison"},{"text":"Renewal identifi